,"width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x6f8499","original_size":2305222,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/c240c261d82df0db04dbaf626e6fd645.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/08b28fa4e8038825b14dfd1ba6033194.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/08b28fa4e8038825b14dfd1ba6033194.png/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/08b28fa4e8038825b14dfd1ba6033194.png/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/08b28fa4e8038825b14dfd1ba6033194.png","original_format":"png","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x3b3b79","original_size":2176662,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/08b28fa4e8038825b14dfd1ba6033194.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/c4600c69ae4d61023bcbe8b8a055573e.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/c4600c69ae4d61023bcbe8b8a055573e.png/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/c4600c69ae4d61023bcbe8b8a055573e.png/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/c4600c69ae4d61023bcbe8b8a055573e.png","original_format":"png","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x998358","original_size":2270178,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/c4600c69ae4d61023bcbe8b8a055573e.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/7cbbb8a7bef2a958d2dd71cccf2da978.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/7cbbb8a7bef2a958d2dd71cccf2da978.jpg/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/7cbbb8a7bef2a958d2dd71cccf2da978.jpg/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/7cbbb8a7bef2a958d2dd71cccf2da978.jpg","original_format":"jpeg","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x6e8499","original_size":1524852,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/7cbbb8a7bef2a958d2dd71cccf2da978.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/ebf556f5b928c0ac6826f6ade1eefc14.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/ebf556f5b928c0ac6826f6ade1eefc14.png/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/ebf556f5b928c0ac6826f6ade1eefc14.png/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/ebf556f5b928c0ac6826f6ade1eefc14.png","original_format":"png","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x929969","original_size":2341270,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/ebf556f5b928c0ac6826f6ade1eefc14.png/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/6efa972f4520106672d8b1b704d487c9.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/6efa972f4520106672d8b1b704d487c9.jpg/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/6efa972f4520106672d8b1b704d487c9.jpg/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/6efa972f4520106672d8b1b704d487c9.jpg","original_format":"jpeg","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x412873","original_size":1323684,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/6efa972f4520106672d8b1b704d487c9.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/1e0173fd17918982f2dc8a2cfaf72017.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/1e0173fd17918982f2dc8a2cfaf72017.jpg/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/1e0173fd17918982f2dc8a2cfaf72017.jpg/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/1e0173fd17918982f2dc8a2cfaf72017.jpg","original_format":"jpeg","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x99986d","original_size":1274687,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/1e0173fd17918982f2dc8a2cfaf72017.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/fd6667b21916348b79e655bedf1de7d7.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/fd6667b21916348b79e655bedf1de7d7.jpg/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/fd6667b21916348b79e655bedf1de7d7.jpg/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/fd6667b21916348b79e655bedf1de7d7.jpg","original_format":"jpeg","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x3e7073","original_size":1573719,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/fd6667b21916348b79e655bedf1de7d7.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg"},{"url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/5139912a095c1b20e7f37bb1f89391a7.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg","medium_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/5139912a095c1b20e7f37bb1f89391a7.jpg/_tap_screenshot_m.jpg","small_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/5139912a095c1b20e7f37bb1f89391a7.jpg/_tap_screenshot_s.jpg","original_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/5139912a095c1b20e7f37bb1f89391a7.jpg","original_format":"jpeg","width":1920,"height":1080,"color":"0x2a2a73","original_size":1549054,"large_url":"https://img-tc.tapimg.com/market/images/5139912a095c1b20e7f37bb1f89391a7.jpg/_tap_screenshot.jpg"}],"description":{"text":"在七种元素交汇的大陆——「提瓦特」，每个人都可以成为神。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e你从世界之外漂流而来，降临大地。在这广阔的世界中，你自由旅行、结识同伴、寻找掌控尘世元素的七神，直到与分离的血亲重聚，在终点见证一切旅途的沉淀。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e维系者正在死去，创造者尚未到来。面对无法掌控的境遇，人类总会喟叹自身的无力……\u003cbr/\u003e但在人生最陡峭的转折处，若有凡人的渴望达到极致，神明的视线就将投射而下。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e当失散的双子在尘沙中重聚、世界的谜底在「神之眼」中尽数显现之时——\u003cbr/\u003e旅行者，你将去往何方？\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e《原神》是由米哈游自研的一款全新开放世界冒险RPG。你将在游戏中探索一个被称作「提瓦特」的幻想世界。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e在这广阔的世界中，你可以踏遍七国，邂逅性格各异、能力独特的同伴，与他们一同对抗强敌，踏上寻回血亲之路；也可以不带目的地漫游，沉浸在充满生机的世界里，让好奇心驱使自己发掘各个角落的奥秘……"},"developer_note":{"text":"亲爱的旅行者：\u003cbr/\u003e全新7.1版本「往冥府的安魂歌」现已推出！\u003cbr/\u003e各位旅行者重新下载客户端后即可继续进行体验。此次更新资源较大，建议旅行者在WiFi环境下进行版本升级。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e〓更新时间〓\u003cbr/\u003e2026/09/23 06:00开始，预计5个小时完成。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e〓客户端更新方式〓\u003cbr/\u003e进入游戏后，按照游戏内弹窗提示完成更新。\u003cbr/\u003e若遇到任何安装问题，请联系客服，我们将为旅行者解决问题。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e〓补偿内容〓\u003cbr/\u003e停服更新补偿：原石*300\u003cbr/\u003e（停服维护每小时补偿60原石。若提前开服，补偿将不会改变。）\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e〓补偿范围〓\u003cbr/\u003e停服更新补偿：2026/09/23 06:00前冒险等阶达到5级及以上的旅行者。\u003cbr/\u003e领取时间截至7.1版本结束前。\u003cbr/\u003e制作组将在维护完成后5小时内，以游戏内邮件的形式，向旅行者发放相应补偿。邮件有效期为30天，请及时领取附件。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e〓更新内容简介〓\u003cbr/\u003e【新角色】薇斯纳、沃雅妮莎\u003cbr/\u003e「雪宴之锋 · 薇斯纳(风)」，「冬契军」司令官，使用单手剑的五星风元素角色，具备使队伍触发星扩散反应的能力；\u003cbr/\u003e「幽歌萦渊 · 沃雅妮莎(水)」，科洛列夫茨基剧团首席女高音，使用法器的五星水元素角色。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【新福利】「桌上剧团 · 冒险的前夜会」、「虹旅藏金 · 耀星烁熠」、「巡历雪境，凝铸锋锐」\u003cbr/\u003e「桌上剧团 · 冒险的前夜会」活动期间，完成相应任务，可邀请当期活动内的一名限定五星角色加入队伍！\u003cbr/\u003e「虹旅藏金 · 耀星烁熠」活动期间，累计签到七天即可获得纠缠之缘*10、启圣之尘等奖励，「佳礼来信」将分为四封邮件累计发放1600原石及更多好礼！\u003cbr/\u003e「巡历雪境，凝铸锋锐」活动开启，登录即可邀请任意一位常驻五星角色加入队伍！\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【新剧情】全新魔神任务\u003cbr/\u003e魔神任务——第七章 第三幕「白夜似梦初醒」、第四幕「往冥府的安魂歌」\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【新活动】版本主题活动「银翎溯月，玄鸟结璘」、阶段性活动「无忧无虑大雪仗」、「判测胜券本征」\u003cbr/\u003e应友人信件的邀请，你和派蒙回到了沉玉谷。在遗珑埠，盛大的节庆已然拉开帷幕…\u003cbr/\u003e参与活动，累积「庆典氛围」，不仅能获得多种奖励，还可以获得限定四星武器「单手剑 · 银釭」！\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【新武器】蝶变、漩流颂歌\u003cbr/\u003e限定五星武器「单手剑 · 蝶变」、「法器 · 漩流颂歌」开放获取。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【新怪物】游雪的护刃\u003cbr/\u003e游雪的护刃是在雪精一族之中拥有相当声望的古老雪精，位于「霜殛寒峰」地区。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【千星奇域更新】全新奇偶装扮、新大厅\u003cbr/\u003e「暄霁霄练」活动颂愿开启，限定传说五星装扮「桂影霄练」开放获取；\u003cbr/\u003e「千星商城」限时上新「黯蔚织网」、「呱呱使者」、「暄霁流辉」等全新装扮开放获取；\u003cbr/\u003e「清虚桂殿·天香流芳」公共大厅更新，全新个人大厅「清虚桂殿·花间独酌」可通过纪游获取。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e【七圣召唤更新】全新角色牌、全新行动牌\u003cbr/\u003e全新角色牌、行动牌开放获取。\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e实际内容请以游戏内为准\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e\u003cbr class=\"bbcode-paragraph-br\"/\u003e•在数据方面：同在官方服务器的情况下，iOS、PC、Android平台之间的账号数据互通，旅行者可以在同一账号下切换设备，畅玩游戏。由于PSN账号限制，旅行者无法使用PSN账号，通过其他平台登录游戏。\u003cbr/\u003e•在玩法方面：同在官方服务器的情况下，达到一定的冒险等阶且完成相应任务后，旅行者可申请加入彼此的游戏世界，参与联机活动。使用 PS4 平台进行游戏的旅行者，也可在官方服务器中，加入其他平台旅行者好友的游戏世界。"},"tags":[{"id":641053,"value":"开放世界","uri":"taptap://taptap.com/library?tag=%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C","web_url":"/tag/%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C"},{"id":641050,"value":"二次元","uri":"taptap://taptap.com/library?tag=%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E5%85%83","web_url":"/tag/%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E5%85%83"},{"id":641029,"value":"角色扮演","uri":"taptap://taptap.com/library?tag=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E6%89%AE%E6%BC%94","web_url":"/tag/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E6%89%AE%E6%BC%94"},{"id":653940,"value":"养成","uri":"taptap://taptap.com/library?tag=%E5%85%BB%E6%88%90","web_url":"/tag/%E5%85%BB%E6%88%90"},{"id":641048,"value":"高自由度","uri":"taptap://taptap.com/library?tag=%E9%AB%98%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BA%A6","web_url":"/tag/%E9%AB%98%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E5%BA%A6"},{"id":641056,"value":"高画质","uri":"taptap://taptap.com/library?tag=%E9%AB%98%E7%94%BB%E8%B4%A8","web_url":"/tag/%E9%AB%98%E7%94%BB%E8%B4%A8"},{"